---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { STUDIO_UNITS } from '../../lib/studio';
---
<BaseLayout hidePageHead={false}
  title="Municipios"
  titleEn="Places"
  description="Hub municipal y estatal BCS 2050 — una página por municipio + síntesis estatal"
  descriptionEn="BCS 2050 municipal and state hub — one page per municipality + statewide synthesis"
  wide={true}
>
  <nav class="su-crumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
    <a href="/mapas/"><span data-lang-es>Territorio</span><span data-lang-en hidden>Territory</span></a>
    <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
    <span><span data-lang-es>Lugares</span><span data-lang-en hidden>Places</span></span>
  </nav>
  <div class="st-hero">
    <h1>
      <span data-lang-es>Lugares del territorio</span>
      <span data-lang-en hidden>Places of the territory</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="lead">
      <span data-lang-es>
        Seis unidades claras: el estado y cinco municipios. Cada página reúne vocación,
        demanda–oferta, preguntas estratégicas y señales — sin repetir cinco módulos sueltos.
      </span>
      <span data-lang-en hidden>
        Six clear units: the state and five municipalities. Each page gathers vocation,
        demand–supply, strategic questions and signals — without five separate modules.
      </span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <a href="/gemelo/"><span data-lang-es>Comparar en el gemelo</span><span data-lang-en hidden>Compare in the twin</span></a>
      {' · '}
      <a href="/vistas/"><span data-lang-es>Vistas guardadas</span><span data-lang-en hidden>Saved views</span></a>
      {' · '}
      <a href="/foro/"><span data-lang-es>Hoja para invitados</span><span data-lang-en hidden>Guest sheet</span></a>
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="st-grid">
    {STUDIO_UNITS.map((u) => (
      <a class="st-card" href={`/studio/${u.id}/`}>
        <h2>
          <span data-lang-es>{u.name_es}</span>
          <span data-lang-en hidden>{u.name_en}</span>
        </h2>
        <p>
          <span data-lang-es>{u.blurb_es}</span>
          <span data-lang-en hidden>{u.blurb_en}</span>
        </p>
        {u.placeIds.length > 1 && u.id !== 'bcs' && (
          <p class="st-nested">
            <span data-lang-es>Incluye: {u.placeIds.join(' · ').replace(/_/g, ' ')}</span>
            <span data-lang-en hidden>Includes: {u.placeIds.join(' · ').replace(/_/g, ' ')}</span>
          </p>
        )}
        <span class="st-go">→</span>
      </a>
    ))}
  </div>

  <p class="st-foot meta">
    <span data-lang-es>
      Detalle de catálogo, mapas y guías temáticas vive en Evidencia y Temas.
      Las rutas antiguas (/lugares, /crecimiento, …) redirigen o siguen como biblioteca.
    </span>
    <span data-lang-en hidden>
      Catalog, maps and topic guides live under Evidence and Themes.
      Legacy routes (/lugares, /crecimiento, …) redirect or remain as a library.
    </span>
  </p>

  <style is:global>
    .st-hero { margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
    .st-hero h1 { font-size: 1.65rem; color: #23374a; margin: 0 0 0.4rem; }
    .st-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(260px, 1fr));
      gap: 0.9rem;
    }
    .st-card {
      position: relative;
      display: block;
      padding: 1.1rem 1.15rem 1.25rem;
      border: 1px solid #e2dccf;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: #fbf8f1;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: inherit;
      box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,128,192,0.06);
      transition: border-color 0.15s, box-shadow 0.15s;
    }
    .st-card:hover {
      border-color: #34607d;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,128,192,0.12);
    }
    .st-card h2 {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      margin: 0 0 0.35rem;
      color: #34607d;
    }
    .st-card p { margin: 0; font-size: 0.88rem; color: #3c5163; line-height: 1.4; }
    .st-nested { margin-top: 0.45rem !important; font-size: 0.75rem !important; color: #5c6e7b !important; }
    .st-go {
      position: absolute;
      right: 1rem;
      bottom: 0.85rem;
      color: #34607d;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .st-foot { margin-top: 1.75rem; font-size: 0.82rem; color: #5c6e7b; }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
